    "title": "Dairy lovers unite at new Milk Club on JMU's campus - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Hendrix ,\n15 hours ago The new Milk Club at JMU is exactly what it sounds like — a place where students gather to drink milk. Freshman engineering major Josiah Medlin started the year strong, looking to bring people together at JMU with a lighthearted, silly idea. Inspired by his sister, who started the Milk Club at the University of Cincinnati, Medlin brought the family legacy here. Read full article",
